## Public Scan — Subdomain Scanning & Quantum Security Assessment Enhancement

In:

`http://localhost:3000/public-scan`

Please enhance the **Public Scan** functionality to support **main-domain + subdomain scanning**, while maintaining the existing scanner architecture, security controls, data integrity, and premium enterprise-grade user experience.

### 1. Main Requirement

Allow users to perform a Public Scan against:

- Their primary/root domain
- Up to **10 subdomains** belonging to that domain

The maximum scope per Public Scan must therefore be:

> **1 Main Domain + up to 10 Subdomains = Maximum 11 targets**

Example:

```text
example.com
www.example.com
api.example.com
mail.example.com
vpn.example.com
portal.example.com
app.example.com
dev.example.com
staging.example.com
secure.example.com
auth.example.com
```

The user must **not be allowed to exceed 10 subdomains** in a single Public Scan.

