# 14. Scan Execution

Design the scan pipeline so that multiple targets can be processed safely without:

- Race conditions
- Duplicate findings
- Cross-target result contamination
- Incorrect aggregation
- UI state corruption
- Timeout propagation
- One failed target terminating unrelated scans

Use controlled concurrency appropriate for the existing infrastructure.

Do not bypass existing security/rate-limit protections.

